M16 design calculation: 40 labels (m16int|design|0..39), 0 excluded, 917 s
Per evaluation world (16 per label): EVENT = 3 open + 5 blocked + 5 after episodes, a route edge blocked after episode 3, reopened with p (RARE 0.1, OFTEN 0.9); PREBLOCK = 3 episodes, a route edge blocked from the start in a share 0.5 of worlds, never reopened.
Steps are summed over the 16 evaluation worlds of a label; intervals are 95% percentile bootstrap over labels.

